  Sliders, for the button widgets' picker previews only.

  The previews used to be the real layout, which hardcodes the horn, so all
  five button widgets appeared in the picker as a horn and a rider could not
  tell them apart or guess that the action is theirs to choose. This says
  "a slot you configure" instead of naming an action the widget may not carry.

  White, like the other widget icons: widgets sit outside the app's theme
  system and are always drawn on the dark widget background.
-->
